    "body": "In this episode of Denatured, you’ll hear from from Lewis Bender, CEO at Intensity Therapeutics and Paul-Peter Tak, president, CEO and board director at Candel Therapeutics. We explore how intratumoral therapies trigger systemic anticancer immunity from a local injection, and redefine a foundational platform in immuno-oncology.\n> Listen on Spotify > Listen on Apple Podcasts > Listen on Amazon Music > LIsten on iHeart > Watch on YouTube\nIn this episode of Denatured, you’ll listen to Lewis Bender, CEO at Intensity Therapeutics and Paul-Peter Tak, president, CEO and board director at Candel Therapeutics. We investigate how intratumoral therapies can generate systemic antitumor immune responses from a localized injection, advancing a foundational platform in immuno-oncology.\nHost\n⁠ Jennifer C. Smith-Parker , Director of Insights, BioSpace\nGuests\nLewis Bender , President & CEO, Intensity Therapeutics\nPaul-Peter Tak , President, CEO and Board Director, Candel Therapeutics\nDisclaimer: The views expressed in this discussion by guests are their own and do not represent those of their organizations.",
